<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13904] Don&apos;t use rows buffers by reduce index for simple one-way reducer</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13904</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Now the reducer&apos;s index buffer &lt;tt&gt;AbstractReducer#fetched&lt;/tt&gt; is used even for simple plain query. It is the cause of increased memory usage for plain query.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proposed fix:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;don&apos;t use index buffer for simple reducer (for plain query).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
